<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ First's Wyllie confirmed winner of Te Tai Tonga.</title>
<headline>NZ First's Wyllie confirmed winner of Te Tai Tonga.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Long-serving Labour MP Whetu Tirikatene-Sullivan on Thursday conceded defeat to New Zealand First's Tutekawa Wyllie in the Te Tai Tonga Maori electorate after counting of special votes.</p>
<p>The result confirms NZ First's clean sweep of all five Maori electorates in the October 12 general election.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
